  "solution": {
    "text": "After critical angle reflection will be $100 \\%$ and transmission is $0 \\%$. Options (b) and (c) satisfy this condition. But option (c) is the correct option. Because in option (b) transmission is given $100 \\%$ at $\\theta=0^{\\circ}$, which is not true.\nAnalysis of Question\nFrom examination point of view question is moderately difficult. Because it takes little time to understand the given graphs clearly.",
